Module486213Name = DoliZUGFeRD
Module486213Desc = Automatic Factur-X EN16931 e-invoice generation

DoliZugferdSetup = DoliZUGFeRD setup
DoliZugferdBankAccount = Bank account (IBAN/BIC)
DoliZugferdPaymentMeans = Default payment means
DoliZugferdPaymentMeansHint = UNTDID 4461 code. 30/58 (credit transfer) require an IBAN: without a configured bank account, the payment means block is omitted from the XML (BR-61). 59 (SEPA direct debit) publishes the creditor ICS (Dolibarr constant PRELEVEMENT_ICS), the mandate reference and the IBAN of the third party's default bank account.
PaymentMeans30 = Credit transfer
PaymentMeans58 = SEPA credit transfer
PaymentMeans59 = SEPA direct debit
PaymentMeans49 = Direct debit (national)
DoliZugferdBrCheck = EN16931 business rules check
DoliZugferdBrCheckHint = Checks a subset of the EN16931 Schematron rules before injection (BR-CO-10..17, BR-27, BR-61, BR-IC-11/12, VAT category consistency...). Violations block in strict mode, otherwise they are added to the warnings.
DoliZugferdVeraPdfPath = PDF/A-3 validation with veraPDF (optional, external tool)
DoliZugferdVeraPdfPathHint = Empty by default = disabled, and that's fine: the EN16931 XSD check and internal BR rules already run. veraPDF is NOT shipped with the module — it's a third-party tool you install yourself (https://verapdf.org), then point to here. If set, every PDF is re-validated as PDF/A-3b after injection: non blocking (a failure just adds a warning), slows generation by a few seconds.
DoliZugferdVeraPdfPlaceholder = e.g. /usr/local/bin/verapdf — empty = disabled
DoliZugferdInfo = Generated PDF invoices will automatically be converted to Factur-X EN16931 (PDF/A-3 with embedded CrossIndustryInvoice XML). IBAN and BIC are read from the selected bank account.
DoliZugferdDiagTitle = Mandatory information diagnostic
DoliZugferdDiagResults = Factur-X EN16931 + BR-FR rules check
DoliZugferdDiagSellerName = Seller company name
DoliZugferdDiagSellerAddress = Seller address
DoliZugferdDiagSellerVAT = Intra-community VAT number
DoliZugferdDiagSellerVATFranchise = not required (French VAT franchise, art. 293 B CGI) — the SIREN is published as tax identifier
DoliZugferdDiagSellerSIRET = SIRET / SIREN
DoliZugferdDiagSellerSteuernummer = Seller tax number (BT-32)
DoliZugferdDiagSellerSteuernummerNotNeeded = not set — not required, VAT ID present
DoliZugferdDiagSellerTaxIdMissing = Seller tax number or VAT ID missing — one of them is mandatory (BR-CO-26)
DoliZugferdDiagSellerEmail = Seller email
DoliZugferdDiagIBAN = Bank account IBAN
DoliZugferdDiagBIC = Bank account BIC
DoliZugferdDiagBankNotFound = Bank account not found
DoliZugferdDiagBankNotSet = No bank account selected
DoliZugferdDiagModuleBankEnabled = Bank module enabled
DoliZugferdDiagModuleBankDisabled = Bank module disabled (required to manage the bank account)
DoliZugferdDiagModuleInvoiceEnabled = Invoice module enabled
DoliZugferdDiagModuleInvoiceDisabled = Invoice module disabled (required to generate invoices)
DoliZugferdDiagForceFontOk = Embedded PDF font forced (MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT)
DoliZugferdDiagForceFontMissing = MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT not set — without embedded fonts, the PDF is not PDF/A-3 compliant
DoliZugferdDiagInjInProcess = In-process injection (no exec) forced — works on servers where exec() is disabled
DoliZugferdDiagInjAuto = Automatic mode: subprocess injection (exec available) — isolated PHP process, the safest path
DoliZugferdDiagInjAutoNoExec = Automatic mode: in-process injection (exec disabled on this server — no alternative available)
DoliZugferdDiagInjSubprocess = Subprocess injection (exec) — legacy mode forced
DoliZugferdDiagExecRequiredSub = "Subprocess" mode selected but exec() is disabled on this server — switch to "Automatic" or "In-process" in the configuration
DoliZugferdDiagTcpdiConflict = In-process injection will fail: Dolibarr loads its "tcpdi" PDF engine on every generation (a TCPDF-based FPDF, incompatible with the Factur-X injection library). Two solutions: enable the exec() function on the server (the module then uses an isolated subprocess, recommended), OR set the constant MAIN_DISABLE_TCPDI = 1 (unblocks in-process, but disables Dolibarr's PDF merge features — page backgrounds, concatenation).
DoliZugferdErrTcpdiConflict = FPDF/TCPDF conflict: Dolibarr loaded its tcpdi engine (%s), incompatible with in-process injection. Enable exec() (subprocess mode) or set the MAIN_DISABLE_TCPDI=1 constant (disables Dolibarr PDF merging).
DoliZugferdDiagPhpCliOk = PHP CLI binary
DoliZugferdDiagPhpCliNotFound = The configured PHP CLI binary cannot be found or is not executable: %s
DoliZugferdDiagMulticurrencyNote = Multicurrency module enabled: invoices in a foreign currency are NOT converted to Factur-X (documented limitation, the classic PDF is kept)
DoliZugferdDiagFixLink = Fix
DoliZugferdDiagFixForceFont = Fix automatically (sets "pdfahelvetica")
DoliZugferdForceFontSet = MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT set to "pdfahelvetica": generated PDFs now embed fonts (PDF/A-3). Global setting, applied to every PDF document in Dolibarr.
DoliZugferdDiagAllOk = All mandatory information is filled in!
DoliZugferdDiagNoBlocker = No blocker: Factur-X compliance is ensured. A few recommended items remain (in orange) you may address for an optimal result.

DoliZugferdStrictMode = Error handling mode
DoliZugferdStrictModeHint = Best-effort: if Factur-X generation fails, the classic PDF is delivered with a warning. Strict: blocks generation with a visible error if the XML is invalid or the PDF injection fails. Note: even in strict mode, the classic PDF already generated by Dolibarr remains on disk.
DoliZugferdStrictModeBestEffort = Best-effort (default, non blocking)
DoliZugferdStrictModeStrict = Strict (blocks if Factur-X fails)
DoliZugferdInjectionMode = XML injection mode
DoliZugferdInjectionModeHint = "Automatic" (recommended): subprocess if exec() is available (the safest, isolated path), and in-process only if exec() is disabled (hardened shared hosting). "In-process only" forces injection without exec() — reserve it for servers without exec(), since a PDF library conflict with another module can then prevent injection. "Subprocess" forces the legacy behaviour (requires exec()).
DoliZugferdInjectionModeAuto = Automatic (subprocess if exec, otherwise in-process)
DoliZugferdInjectionModeInProcess = In-process only (no exec)
DoliZugferdInjectionModeSubprocess = Subprocess (exec, legacy)
DoliZugferdPhpCliPath = PHP CLI binary path
DoliZugferdPhpCliPathHint = Used only by the "subprocess" mode. Leave empty: the module auto-detects the right PHP CLI binary. Set a path only to force a specific binary (exotic setup).
DoliZugferdLegalNotes = Mandatory French legal mentions (BR-FR-05)
DoliZugferdNotePMD = Late payment penalties (PMD)
DoliZugferdNotePMT = Recovery indemnity (PMT)
DoliZugferdNoteAAB = Early payment discount (AAB)
DoliZugferdLegalNotesForeignHint = Seller established outside France: no default mention is applied (the default texts come from the French Commercial Code). Fields left empty produce no note in the XML — enter your own mentions here if your national law requires them.

DoliZugferdUpdateAvailable = New version available
DoliZugferdUpdateAvailableMsg = A newer version of the module is published on GitHub (%s, current: %s).
DoliZugferdUpdateSeeRelease = See the release and upgrade instructions

DoliZugferdBtnVerify = Verify Factur-X
DoliZugferdBtnRegenerate = Regenerate Factur-X
DoliZugferdMsgNoPdf = No PDF found for this invoice — generate the document first.
DoliZugferdMsgNoFacturX = No Factur-X XML embedded in %s — use "Regenerate Factur-X".
DoliZugferdMsgVerifyOk = %s: embedded Factur-X XML found, EN16931 XSD valid and business rules checked.
DoliZugferdMsgVerifyKo = %s: embedded Factur-X XML found but not compliant:
DoliZugferdMsgRegenerateFailed = PDF regeneration failed
DoliZugferdMsgSuccess = Factur-X EN16931 e-invoice embedded in PDF %s.
DoliZugferdMsgSuccessWithWarnings = Factur-X EN16931 e-invoice embedded in PDF %s. %s non blocking warning(s) to fix for full compliance:

# ODT template support (experimental, v3.8.0) — afterODTCreation hook
DoliZugferdOdtErrNoPdfConv = ODT template without PDF conversion: Factur-X requires a PDF, but only the .odt file was produced
DoliZugferdOdtHintEnable = set MAIN_ODT_AS_PDF = libreoffice (and install LibreOffice on the server) to convert the ODT to PDF before injection
DoliZugferdOdtErrNoPdfa = the PDF produced from the ODT template is not PDF/A: LibreOffice then outputs a PDF >= 1.5 (compressed xref table) that the Factur-X injection library cannot read
DoliZugferdOdtHintEnablePdfa = set MAIN_ODT_AS_PDF = libreoffice + MAIN_ODT_AS_PDFA = 1 to produce a readable, injectable PDF/A-1
DoliZugferdOdtErrPdfMissing = expected PDF not found next to the ODT template (%s): the LibreOffice conversion probably failed (soffice binary missing or not in PATH)

DoliZugferdErrMulticurrency = invoice in a foreign currency (%s ≠ company currency %s) — unsupported: the XML would diverge from the visible PDF (documented limitation)
DoliZugferdErrLocalTax = invoice with local taxes (localtax1/2) — unsupported: EN16931 only represents VAT, the XML total would diverge from the visible PDF total (documented limitation)
DoliZugferdErrNoDate = invoice has no issue date
DoliZugferdErrNoThirdparty = buyer third party not found (fetch_thirdparty failed)
DoliZugferdErrNoMysoc = issuing company ($mysoc) not initialised
DoliZugferdErrInvalidXml = invalid XML
DoliZugferdErrBrViolations = EN16931 business rules violated
DoliZugferdErrTempDir = unable to create a temporary file in %s
DoliZugferdErrTempWrite = unable to write the temporary XML in %s
DoliZugferdErrNoExec = the exec() function is disabled on this server
DoliZugferdErrPhpCliChars = DOLIZUGFERD_PHP_CLI_PATH contains forbidden characters (expected: alphanumeric path, "/ . _ - : ( ) \" and space)
DoliZugferdErrPhpCliNotFound = the configured PHP binary cannot be found or is not executable: %s
DoliZugferdErrInjectFailed = PDF injection failed
DoliZugferdHintPdfKept = classic PDF kept without Factur-X
DoliZugferdHintPdfKeptShort = classic PDF kept
DoliZugferdHintBestEffort = best-effort mode

DoliZugferdWarnSellerName = seller company name missing
DoliZugferdWarnSellerAddress = seller company address missing
DoliZugferdWarnSellerZip = seller company zip code missing
DoliZugferdWarnSellerTown = seller company town missing
DoliZugferdWarnSellerVAT = intra-community VAT number missing (company)
DoliZugferdWarnSellerVATInvalid = The company VAT ID field contains "%s", which is not a VAT ID (it must start with the country code, e.g. DE123456789). It is not output as VAT ID (BR-CO-09).
DoliZugferdWarnSellerSIRET = SIRET/SIREN missing (company) — mandatory BR-FR-10
DoliZugferdWarnSellerEndpoint = seller electronic address missing (no SIREN/SIRET, no email) — mandatory BR-FR-13 (BT-34)
DoliZugferdWarnSellerSIRETLen = the seller SIRET must contain exactly 14 digits (BT-30), %s entered — a 9-digit SIREN is rejected by Chorus Pro
DoliZugferdWarnBuyerName = buyer name missing
DoliZugferdWarnBuyerAddress = buyer address missing
DoliZugferdWarnBuyerZip = buyer zip code missing
DoliZugferdWarnBuyerTown = buyer town missing
DoliZugferdWarnBuyerEndpoint = buyer electronic address missing (no SIREN/SIRET, no email) — mandatory BR-FR-12 (BT-49)
DoliZugferdWarnBuyerSIRENRouting = buyer SIREN/SIRET missing — required for routing on the Plateformes Agréées network (endpoint BT-49 schemeID 0225); an email alone is not routable
DoliZugferdWarnBuyerSIRETLen = the buyer SIRET must contain exactly 14 digits (BT-47), %s entered
DoliZugferdWarnNoBank = no bank account configured in the module
DoliZugferdWarnNoForceFont = MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT not set — the generated PDF is not guaranteed PDF/A-3 (fonts not embedded); fixable in one click from the DoliZUGFeRD module setup (diagnostic)
DoliZugferdWarnPaymentMeansOmitted = payment means %s (credit transfer) omitted from XML: no IBAN configured (BR-61 — configure a bank account in the module)
DoliZugferdWarnDirectDebitNoICS = SEPA direct debit: creditor ICS missing (BT-90) — set the Dolibarr constant PRELEVEMENT_ICS
DoliZugferdWarnDirectDebitNoRUM = SEPA direct debit: mandate reference (RUM) missing (BT-89) — fill in the third party's default bank account with its mandate reference
DoliZugferdWarnCreditNoteNoSource = credit note without a linked source invoice: the reference to the original invoice (BG-3, mandatory French mention) cannot be emitted — create the credit note from the original invoice
DoliZugferdWarnAllNegativeLines = fully negative invoice that is not a credit note: lines emitted as-is, the XML violates BR-27 (use a Dolibarr credit note)
DoliZugferdWarnSituationInvoice = situation (progress billing) invoice: emitted as TypeCode 380, but the mapping of cumulative amounts/retentions is not guaranteed compliant (documented limitation)
DoliZugferdWarnRoundingAdjusted = VAT rounding gap of %s spread on the main category to guarantee BR-CO-14 (check the totals)
DoliZugferdWarnTaxMismatch = gap of %s between line VAT and the invoice VAT total, not attributable (no taxed category)
DoliZugferdWarnTaxRecomputed = VAT of category %s recomputed from its basis (%s instead of %s) to satisfy BR-CO-17 — the gap with the Dolibarr total comes from per-line rounding (check the rounding mode)
DoliZugferdWarnTotalsMismatch = XML grand total (%s) differs from the Dolibarr total (%s) — local taxes or inconsistent lines; the XML favours EN16931 internal consistency (BR-CO-15)
DoliZugferdWarnVeraPdfNotFound = veraPDF not found or not executable: %s (DOLIZUGFERD_VERAPDF_PATH)
DoliZugferdWarnVeraPdfFailed = veraPDF: the generated PDF is not PDF/A-3b compliant (details in syslog) — check MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT and the PDF template images
DoliZugferdWarnBrPrefix = EN16931 business rule:
DoliZugferdWarnCorrectiveNoSource = corrective invoice without a linked source invoice: the reference to the replaced invoice (BT-25, required by rule BR-FR-CO-04) cannot be emitted — create the replacement invoice from the original invoice
DoliZugferdWarnRefTooLong = invoice reference (BT-1) too long: %s characters, maximum 35 (rule BR-FR-01)
DoliZugferdWarnRefCharset = invoice reference (BT-1) "%s" contains characters that are not allowed — allowed: letters, digits and - + _ / , no space (rule BR-FR-02)
DoliZugferdWarnSellerSirenSiretMismatch = seller SIREN (%s) and SIRET (%s) are inconsistent: the first 9 digits of the SIRET must match the SIREN (rule BR-FR-09) — fix the company card
DoliZugferdWarnBuyerSirenSiretMismatch = buyer SIREN (%s) and SIRET (%s) are inconsistent: the first 9 digits of the SIRET must match the SIREN (rule BR-FR-09) — fix the third-party card
DoliZugferdWarnVatRateNotFR = VAT rate %s %% is not in the list of allowed French rates, mainland and overseas departments (rule BR-FR-16) — check the input if this rate is not intentional
DoliZugferdWarnEndpointSuffixCharset = the seller electronic address suffix (DOLIZUGFERD_ENDPOINT_SUFFIX_SELLER) contains characters that are not allowed — only letters, digits and - _ . are kept when emitting (rule BR-FR-23)
DoliZugferdWarnEndpointTooLong = seller electronic address is %s characters long: maximum 125 (rule BR-FR-25) — shorten the configured suffix

