DoliZugferdSecPA = Approved Platform (PA) addressing
DoliZugferdEndpointSuffixSeller = Seller endpoint suffix (BT-34)
DoliZugferdEndpointSuffixSellerHint = Suffix appended to the issuer SIREN in the seller electronic address. Some Approved Platforms (e.g. Hubtimize/Esalink) require this address NOT to be the bare SIREN but a suffixed Peppol endpoint — "SIREN_Status" (lifecycle-status return address), as configured when registering the entity. Must match, byte for byte, the address registered on the PA. Empty = bare SIREN (legacy PPF directory). Does NOT affect the buyer address (BT-49), always kept as bare SIREN.
